The [[Bollywood]] film ''[[LOC Kargil]]'' (2003) gives an account of all of the PVC recipients from the [[Kargil War]]. [[Manoj Kumar Pandey|Lieutenant Manoj Kumar Pandey]] is played by [[Ajay Devgan]], [[Yogendra Singh Yadav|Subedar Major (Hony Capt) Yogendra Singh Yadav]] is played by [[Manoj Bajpayee]], [[Sanjay Kumar (soldier)|Subedar Major Sanjay Kumar]] is played by [[Sunil Shetty]], and [[Vikram Batra|Captain Vikram Batra]] is played by [[Abhishek Bachchan]].<ref name="The Hindu : LOC-Kagil: How `real'?">{{Cite web |title=LOC-Kagil: How 'real'? |url=http://www.thehindu.com/mag/2004/01/18/stories/2004011800140500.htm |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://archive.today/20150121060212/http://www.thehindu.com/mag/2004/01/18/stories/2004011800140500.htm |archive-date=21 January 2015 |access-date=5 September 2016 |website=[[The Hindu]]}}</ref>

An upcoming Hindi-language film [[Ikkis]] will focus on the life on [[Arun Khetarpal]], who is the youngest recipient of the award.

In the 2021 film ''[[Shershaah]]'', [[Sidharth Malhotra]] played [[Vikram Batra]] in a biopic directed by [[Vishnuvardhan (director)|Vishnuvardhan]].<ref>{{Cite news |date=5 June 2018 |title=Kargil martyr Vikram Batra's brother on his biopic: I hope Sidharth Malhotra does justice to Vikram |language=en |work=Hindustan Times |url=https://www.hindustantimes.com/bollywood/kargil-martyr-vikram-batra-s-brother-on-his-biopic-i-hope-sidharth-malhotra-does-justice-to-vikram/story-FHKGDONGTqRVdoHgmPTi7L.html |access-date=17 July 2019}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |date=16 July 2019 |title=कैप्टन विक्रम बत्रा की बराबरी करने कम हील वाले शूज पहनेंगे सिद्धार्थ, फिल्म के लिए ले रहे हार्ड ट्रेनिंग |language=hi |trans-title=Siddharth will wear low-heeled shoes to match Captain Vikram Batra, taking hard training for the film |work=Dainik Bhaskar |url=https://www.bhaskar.com/bollywood/news/sidharth-malhotra-will-wear-short-heeled-shoes-to-match-captain-vikram-batra-01595633.html |access-date=17 July 2019}}</ref>

